invariant: INV-38
file: tls_write.c
catches: unit
reason: ch_write_parts fills a record with up to the limit from each part
  it crosses, not up to the limit in all, so a record that crosses a part
  carries more plaintext than the peer's record_size_limit allows.
  test_write_parts requires the wire bytes of ch_write over the joined
  parts, whose records keep the limit.

--- old
        size_t room = limit - w->len;
--- new
        size_t room = limit;
